We at \acro{ISKCON} Belagavi use \XeLaTeX\ primarily to publish books,  print prayer sheets, weekly planners, monthly lecture schedules and create slideshows \Dash all bilingual/trilingual, in
Devan\=agar\=i, Kannada and Roman.  In this article, I wish to share:

\begin{enumerate}
 \item code snippets to show how we obtained desired results in our publications. 
 \item how ``separation of form and content'' benefitted us.
\end{enumerate}

The overall goal is to inspire beginners to get started in using \LaTeX\ for their publishing needs although they may not know all the subtleties and details involved therein.
